{"story":{"id":"event-namarian-30","title":{"zh":"星海游牧舰队","en":"Galactic Nomad Fleet"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":null,"start":"namarian.30","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚常伴你们左右，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。","en":"Cold days and warm nights upon you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"namarian.30","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"外交联络时","en":"On diplomatic contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"namarian.30","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"星海游牧舰队","en":"Galactic Nomad Fleet"},"texts":[{"zh":"愿凉爽的白天和温暖的夜晚常伴你们左右，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。","en":"Cold days and warm nights upon you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]."},{"zh":"祝福你们，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。希望你们相处愉快。","en":"Pleasant winds to you, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We hope you are doing well."},{"zh":"你们有什么要求，[Root.GetSpeciesAdj]？","en":"What do you want, [Root.GetSpeciesAdj]?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"namarian.30.a","label":{"zh":"再多给我们讲讲你们的帝国。","en":"Tell us more about your people."},"responses":[{"zh":"正如我们初步和谈时说过的，我们来自逐浪者舰队。我们世世代代穿梭于恒星间的虚无太空，且将世代延续下去。\n\n舰队由许多个体组成，所有人都必须为了我们的目标倾尽全力。有些人希望脱离出去，在天体上殖民，但大多数人都想穿越下一片虚空，看看之后的景象。","en":"As we mentioned at our introductory parley, we are the people of the Pursuing Waters fleet. We have traveled the stars and the voids-between for many generations, and will continue to do so for many more.\n\nThe fleet hosts a collection of individuals who all are required to do their best to enable our progress. Some wish to leave and establish a new orb-bound life for themselves, but most wish to see what lies beyond the next void."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}]]},{"key":"namarian.30.a","label":{"zh":"再多给我们讲讲你们的帝国。","en":"Tell us more about your people."},"responses":[{"zh":"请恕我们不愿透露，[Root.GetSpeciesAdj]。还有别的事吗？","en":"We would rather not say, [Root.GetSpeciesAdj]. Was there anything else?"}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true}]]},{"key":"namarian.30.b","label":{"zh":"你们要去哪？","en":"Where are you headed?"},"responses":[{"zh":"我们正沿着多条虚空之河进行探索。这场旅程已经持续千年，但我们仍将继续航行。我们的目标是宇宙的星辰大海。虽然听起来可能有些晦涩难懂，但这充分总结了我们的理想。愿它能为你们遮蔽烈日。","en":"We are on a journey down the river of the many voids-between. It has been millennia, but we sail on. The destination we seek being the ocean of the universe. It might sound cryptic, but this adequately summarizes what we dare share. May it bring you shade."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_like","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_like","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_like","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_like","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}]]},{"key":"namarian.30.b","label":{"zh":"你们要去哪？","en":"Where are you headed?"},"responses":[{"zh":"鉴于你是逐浪者信任的盟友，[Root.GetSpeciesAdj]，我将会告诉你一些事：\n\n舰队目前正处于探索之中。我们的先祖曾经不得不离开母星驶向无垠的深空之中。他们希望我们能够找到我们存在的意义，在他们离开满是沙丘的母星千年之后，我们依旧依照着他们的当初的愿景来制定我们的生存之道。\n\n这就是我们想说的。望你安康。","en":"Being the trusted ally of the Pursuing Waters that you are, [Root.GetSpeciesAdj], we will tell you this:\n\nThe fleet is on a quest. Our ancestors had to leave our birthing orb behind and set sail down the back of night. They wished for us to find the purpose of our people, and we live today by that wish, millennia after they first left the sandy dunes of Home.\n\nThat is all we dare share. May it bring you shade."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_like","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true}]]},{"key":"namarian.30.b","label":{"zh":"你们要去哪？","en":"Where are you headed?"},"responses":[{"zh":"请恕我们不愿透露，[Root.GetSpeciesAdj]。还有别的事吗？","en":"We would rather not say, [Root.GetSpeciesAdj]. Was there anything else?"}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_dislike","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":true}]]},{"key":"namarian.30.c","label":{"zh":"再见。","en":"Goodbye."},"responses":[{"zh":"祝顺利，[Root.GetSpeciesAdj]。","en":"Favorable winds, [Root.GetSpeciesAdj]."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"clears":["nomad_diplomacy_engaged"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/namarian_events.txt","line":1960},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"flag","arg":"nomad_relation_hate","scope":"from/has_relation_flag","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"who","arg":"root","scope":"from/